flowchart TB
    accTitle: A question of an agent
    accDescr: An agent of Dennis, such as an orchestrator on his PC, sends the event pager-ask with gh to the private control repository, with an id, a question and two to four options. Its workflow takes only an event of Dennis himself, checks it and sends it to the Worker, signed. The pager opens a topic for the question, with one button per option. Dennis presses one, or writes his own answer in the topic, and the GitHub App saves it as answers/id.json on the branch pager-answers of the control repository. The agent reads it there with gh, without a secret of its own, and wait takes only an answer newer than the question. An agent that no longer needs the answer sends pager-withdraw: the buttons go, and the topic says that it took the question back.

    agent["`**An agent of Dennis** sends pager-ask with gh: an id, a question and its options`"]
    control["`**The workflow of the control repository** takes only Dennis's own events and sends it on, signed`"]
    topic["`**🤔 A topic of its own** in Telegram, with one button per option`"]
    press["Dennis presses an option, or writes his own answer in the topic"]
    saved["`**answers/id.json** on the branch pager-answers, saved by the GitHub App`"]
    read["The agent reads the answer with gh, one newer than its question"]
    back["`**pager-withdraw** of the agent, which no longer needs it: the buttons go, and the topic says so`"]

    agent --> control --> topic --> press --> saved --> read
    topic -.-> back

    classDef you fill:#f59e0b2e,stroke:#f59e0b,stroke-width:2px
    classDef bot fill:#526cfe2e,stroke:#526cfe,stroke-width:2px
    classDef done fill:#16a34a2e,stroke:#16a34a,stroke-width:2px
    class agent,press you
    class control,topic,back bot
    class saved,read done
